    "body": "## OWNER VISUAL AUTHORITY — W01..W06\n\nOWNER DIRECTIVE:\n`АВТОРИЗУЮ #248 W01-W06 VISUAL EXECUTION. СТАВЬ FIRST RESULT NIGHT PREFLIGHT. НИКАКОЙ НОВОЙ АРХИТЕКТУРЫ.`\n\nAUTHORITY EFFECT:\n- `#248 W01..W06 VISUAL EXECUTION = AUTHORIZED BY OWNER`.\n- Scope is exactly the existing frozen `COSTUME_MECHANICS_R01` witness protocol and its six controls.\n- This authorization does NOT authorize redesign, new architecture/framework/runner, unrelated image work, canon promotion, merge, or downstream gate skipping.\n- Every witness must use the existing source freeze, record concrete artifact identity/hash when execution actually occurs, and undergo the existing cross-witness matrix QC before any `COSTUME_MECHANICS_R01 = PASS` claim.\n- If the execution environment cannot actually perform the visual operation, report that exact blocker; do not fabricate witness creation.\n\nNIGHT MODE:\n`FIRST RESULT NIGHT PREFLIGHT`\nPriority = shortest legal path to first real visual production result.",
